<title>CHINA: Pico says in talks to buy Pico Art stake.</title>
<headline>Pico says in talks to buy Pico Art stake.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pico Far East Holdings Ltd said in a statement on Friday it was in talks with Singapore Technologies Industrial Corp to acquire its 20 percent stake in Pico Art International Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>Pico Far East, which already holds an 80 percent interest in Pico Art through its wholly-owned subsidiary Tinsel Ltd, would hold 100 percent of the company if the acquisition went ahead.</p>
<p>Pico Far East made the statement at the request of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange after a rise of HK$0.225, or 5.92 percent, in Pico Far East shares to HK$4.025 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6933</p>
